#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"afs_syscall, break, fattach, fdetach, ftime, getmsg, getpmsg, gtty, "
"isastream, lock, madvise1, mpx, prof, profil, putmsg, putpmsg, security, "
"stty, tuxcall, ulimit, vserver - unimplemented system calls"
msgstr ""
"afs_syscall, break, fattach, fdetach, ftime, getmsg, getpmsg, gtty, "
"isastream, lock, madvise1, mpx, prof, profil, putmsg, putpmsg, security, "
"stty, tuxcall, ulimit, vserver - nicht implementierte Systemaufrufe"

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "SYNOPSIS"
msgstr "ÜBERSICHT"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "Unimplemented system calls.\n"
msgstr "Nicht implementierte Systemaufrufe.\n"

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "BESCHREIBUNG"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "These system calls are not implemented in the Linux kernel."
msgstr "Diese Systemaufrufe sind im Linux-Kernel nicht implementiert."

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "RETURN VALUE"
msgstr "RÜCKGABEWERT"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "These system calls always return -1 and set I<errno> to B<ENOSYS>."
msgstr ""
"Diese Systemaufrufe geben immer -1 zurück und setzen I<errno> auf B<ENOSYS>."

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "NOTES"
msgstr "ANMERKUNGEN"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Note that B<ftime>(3), B<profil>(3), and B<ulimit>(3)  are implemented as "
"library functions."
msgstr ""
"Beachten Sie, dass B<ftime>(3), B<profil>(3) und B<ulimit>(3) als "
"Bibliotheksfunktionen implementiert sind."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Some system calls, like B<alloc_hugepages>(2), B<free_hugepages>(2), "
"B<ioperm>(2), B<iopl>(2), and B<vm86>(2)  exist only on certain "
"architectures."
msgstr ""
"Einige Systemaufrufe, wie B<alloc_hugepages>(2), B<free_hugepages>(2), "
"B<ioperm>(2), B<iopl>(2) und B<vm86>(2), stehen nur für bestimmte "
"Architekturen zur Verfügung."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Some system calls, like B<ipc>(2), B<create_module>(2), B<init_module>(2), "
"and B<delete_module>(2)  exist only when the Linux kernel was built with "
"support for them."
msgstr ""
"Einige Systemaufrufe, wie B<ipc>(2), B<create_module>(2), B<init_module>(2) "
"und B<delete_module>(2), stehen nur zur Verfügung, wenn der Kernel mit "
"Unterstützung für sie gebaut wurde."

